WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.530
This is the Golden Lion.

00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:02.530
Shiki.

00:00:02.530 --> 00:00:04.730
One of the most powerful characters in all
of One PIece.

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:10.710
A living legend, that fought on one level
with the likes of Rocks, Roger, Garp and Sengoku.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.400
And yet Shiki is a character that even some
of the most hardcore fans don’t even know

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.260
is a canon part of the story.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:23.000
That he’s still alive and well, somewhere
out there in the one piece world.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.269
A world, where now all of his potential rivals,
Kaido, Big Mom and Whitebeard have vanished

00:00:29.269 --> 00:00:34.980
from the playing field at exactly the time
that he promised to carry out his plan to

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.750
take over the world.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:41.379
Is this just a coincidence or is there actual
proof in the story that the Golden Lion has

00:00:41.379 --> 00:00:46.950
been secretly pulling the strings from behind
the scenes, orchestrating all the major events

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.200
in one piece?

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.309
Turns out, there is.

00:00:49.309 --> 00:00:53.730
Not only of Shiki’s fingerprints that he
left throughout the story, but as we’ll

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:56.730
see at the end, also for a friendship with
Roger.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:59.769
Garp and Rocks in his youth.

00:00:59.769 --> 00:01:00.769
Let’s find out why.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:06.080
The Golden Lion Shiki, also known as the flying
pirate, is a bit of an enigma in One Piece.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:10.990
If you’ve heard his name before, you probably
remember Shiki as the main antagonist of the

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:17.110
One PIece movie ‘Strong World’, that came
out in December 2009, that even though it’s

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:22.400
already 13 years old, is still one of the
best One Piece movies ever created.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:26.960
The reason for that is simple: While the events
of Strong World, just like Stampede, Film

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:32.130
Red or Film Z are not part of the official
one piece canon, meaning they never officially

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:38.159
happened as part of the story, Shiki’s character
has been confirmed as canon on multiple occasions

00:01:38.159 --> 00:01:40.860
by Eiichiro Oda, the author of One Piece.

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:46.771
So, unlike other powerful movie characters,
like Uta, Admiral Zypher or former Roger pirate

00:01:46.771 --> 00:01:53.090
Dougles Bullet, the golden lion shiki is confirmed
to be alive somewhere out in the one piece

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:54.090
world.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:02:00.270
And while the events in the movie never happened,
his past and powers are all real, including

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:06.490
his powerful devil fruit ability to make anything
and anyone he touches levitate and control

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:07.869
them at at will.

00:02:07.869 --> 00:02:11.020
As you have guessed, this will of course be
important.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.910
So what do we actually know about this character?

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:15.690
Turns out, quite a lot actually.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:20.800
On top of a number of official mentions in
the regular storyline, Strong World also released

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:26.190
with the official chapter 0 of one piece,
that not only describes most of Shiki’s

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:31.720
past, but also revealed a number of other
impactful events that have been incredibly

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:33.989
important to the story.

00:02:33.989 --> 00:02:40.099
For example, the chapter reveals that Dragon,
Mihawk, Crocodile and Doflamingo were all

00:02:40.099 --> 00:02:42.370
present at Roger’s execution.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:49.519
Or how Shanks recruited Usopps’ father Yasopp
and started his own pirate crew.

00:02:49.519 --> 00:02:54.150
Shiki used to be part of the legendary and
infamous Rocks Pirate crew, that included

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:59.540
the likes of Kaido, Big mom and Whitebeard,
all of who would later turn out to become

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:05.260
emperors of the sea, the most powerful pirates
in the world.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:10.349
After Rocks defeat during the God Valley incident
and the disbandment of the crew, Shiki became

00:03:10.349 --> 00:03:15.620
a captain himself, leading the strongest and
largest pirate fleet on the planet and becoming

00:03:15.620 --> 00:03:17.319
a pillar of the ‘old era’.

00:03:17.319 --> 00:03:22.330
He had a lot of respect for Roger, whom he
had a rivalry with, similar to Whitebeard.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:27.410
When Shiki found out that Roger had located
one of the ancient weapons, he tried to persuade

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:33.100
Roger to become his right hand man and together
take over the world, following the dream of

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.120
his former captain, Rocks.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:38.530
When Roger declined this offer, the battle
of Edd War began.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:43.709
Shiki’s fleet had the Roger pirates completely
surrounded, when a sudden change of weather

00:03:43.709 --> 00:03:48.930
sank half of Shiki’s ships and a piece of
wood got stuck in his skull.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:51.010
The Roger pirates were able to escape.

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:56.060
Later, when Roger let himself be captured
by Garp to kick off the great pirate era to

00:03:56.060 --> 00:04:03.470
find the next joy boy, Shiki went to marineford
on his own to stop the Marines, only to find

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:10.440
out that Roger was going to be executed in
his home town of Loguetown located in the

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:11.440
East Blue.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:18.519
That’s right, Shiki did the entire marineford
war on his own, until he was ultimately stopped

00:04:18.519 --> 00:04:24.750
and captured by Garp and Sengoku in battle
that destroyed half the island.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.310
Shiki was brought to impel down.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:31.770
the marine underwater prison legendary for
its cruelty and escape-proof layout.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:36.050
And yet Shiki managed to escape after only
2 years.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:43.030
To this day he remains the only person in
history to ever escape the prison on his own.

00:04:43.030 --> 00:04:47.540
Without batting an eye, he cut off his own
legs to get rid of his sea stone cuffs so

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.780
he could use his ability and escaped.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:57.270
He then replaced his legs with his two named
blades and went to see his old crew mate Whitebeard,

00:04:57.270 --> 00:05:01.539
telling him about a new plan of his that would
be carried out in 20 years.

00:05:01.539 --> 00:05:07.750
In fact, despite his quite comical and charismatic
personality, all other Legends of his era

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:12.139
know him for a cunning schemer and dangerously
powerful enemy.

00:05:12.139 --> 00:05:16.740
And so since SHinki’s actions in strong
world were not canon, but his plan to show

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:23.110
the world hell in 20 years very much is, are
there even any hints at Shiki being active

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:25.190
in the one piece world?

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:26.190
Yes there are.

00:05:26.190 --> 00:05:31.479
And shoutout once again to Mr Bushido who
gave me the idea for this theory on my Subreddit.

00:05:31.479 --> 00:05:32.789
Link below.

00:05:32.789 --> 00:05:34.440
Remember Shiki’s devil fruit?

00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:39.480
The ability to let anything that he touches
levitate with full control over it?

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:45.470
Turns out there are a number of instances
in the story where objects and even people

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:48.120
levitate, that are unexplained to this day.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:52.590
After the war at marineford and in preparation
for the time skip, we see Apoo, a member of

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:58.870
the worst generation, who would later become
part of Kaido’s crew, floating up into the

00:05:58.870 --> 00:05:59.870
sky.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:03.080
Similarly, we see the ship of Capone Bedge,
another member of the worst generation, being

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:06.889
floated into a giant object levitating over
the ocean.

00:06:06.889 --> 00:06:12.440
Then we have this mysterious shrine floating
casually in the air in early wano.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:18.110
We see a mysterious man sharing a cup of Sake
with Crocus, who’s Japanese attire and golden

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.940
hair very much resemble Shiki’s.

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:25.940
And, we see Kurozumi Higurashi, the old hag,
who helped Kaido and Orochi claim power in

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:31.900
Wano, and who wielded Bon Clay’s devil fruit
before him, change her face into that of a

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:33.139
younger Shiki.

00:06:33.139 --> 00:06:38.520
Do these things prove that Shiki is abducting
promising young pirates, scheming with former

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.880
Roger pirates and overthrowing governments?

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:41.880
Well, maybe.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.099
Let’s look at the evidence.

00:06:43.099 --> 00:06:44.800
Let’s start with apoo.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:47.240
There is very little we can go off here.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:53.610
This could be any sort of ability or an invisible
staircase, but so far, Shiki’s is the only

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:57.000
one we know that would allow such a feat.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.970
So it would check out.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:01.660
Now the case of Capone Bege is a lot more
extreme.

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:07.419
He is levitated against his will and sucked
into this giant thing.

00:07:07.419 --> 00:07:09.270
Could this be something else?

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:14.740
It could, but we also know that Shiki’s
ship is a literal floating island, and that

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.479
thing could certainly be just that.

00:07:17.479 --> 00:07:20.580
Why would Shiki want Capone Bege and Apoo
out of all people?

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.400
We’ll get to that.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:27.300
As for the floating shrine in Wano, this could
just be a trick of the perspective or simply

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.000
a drawing error by Oda.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:35.080
However it is deliberately drawn a second
time in the manga, clearly levitating in the

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.080
air.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:41.750
And as Shiki explains to us, things he makes
levitate, will keep levitating until he stops

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.069
it or is knocked unconscious.

00:07:44.069 --> 00:07:45.800
So this one checks out as well.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:50.220
Is that enough though to speculate, that Shiki
will become an active part of the story again,

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:54.919
much less the hidden mastermind that has been
pulling the strings from behind the scenes

00:07:54.919 --> 00:07:58.620
and that Oda has actively kept hidden from
us until his big reveal?

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:03.099
Well at the very least i find it interesting
that Shiki’s face and name have been popping

00:08:03.099 --> 00:08:05.229
up again recently.

00:08:05.229 --> 00:08:10.180
Shiki’s face appearing in Wano, connecting
him to the Kurozumi is one thing, but Sengoku

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:15.240
revealing that he was part of the Rocks pirate
and named in the same sentence as Kaido, Big

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:19.100
mom and Whitebeard did set off some alarm
bells for me.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:25.500
Suddenly Shiki is not only connected to Roger,
Garp and Whitebeard because he was a great

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:29.900
pirate, but now he was also an active part
of the God Valley Incident.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:35.370
And yet he was on friendly terms with Whitebeard
and Roger even after this.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:40.469
We know that Big Mom got Kaido’s mythical
fruit on God Valley and we see the mysterious

00:08:40.469 --> 00:08:44.950
hag who has Shiki’s face give Orochi another
legendary fruit.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:47.490
Could this one also be from that mythical
island?

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:52.779
On top of that, Oda has promised the appearance
of a lurking legend during the wano arc.

00:08:52.779 --> 00:08:58.550
And while no lurking legend actually appeared
in Wano, you could argue that Oda meant the

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:01.150
reveal of Rocks D. Xebec’s existence during
the arc.

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:05.230
However, doesn’t Shiki fit much better into
this role?

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:08.220
He is on the same power level as the other
Yonko.

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:13.980
He is literally one of the legends of the
old era, known by everyone for his epic battles

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:19.089
his escape from impel down, and i think we’ve
made it clear at this point that Shiki has

00:09:19.089 --> 00:09:24.649
been doing nothing else but lurking for the
past 20 years, working on his big plan.

00:09:24.649 --> 00:09:29.550
But even if Shiki is the Lurking Legend and
still doing stuff behind the scenes, how do

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:34.730
we know he’s actually working on something
big and what would a plan like that even look

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:35.730
like?

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:37.760
Turns out we might already know.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:42.820
If there is one consistent theme that Oda
has created around Shiki throughout the years,

00:09:42.820 --> 00:09:44.410
it’s that he’s a schemer.

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:50.779
We have multiple other legendary characters
commenting on his love for big plans and maneuvers.

00:09:50.779 --> 00:09:55.519
Garp says that Shiki is not the type of person
who could tolerate a peaceful era for long,

00:09:55.519 --> 00:10:01.440
but also that he would not start something
big without extensive planning and preparation

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:02.470
beforehand.

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:06.720
When Shiki is on Whitebeards ship after his
grand escape, Whitebeard comments that Shiki

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:09.380
is surely planning something big again.

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:14.279
And even Rayleigh is shown reacting to the
news of Shiki’s escape, wondering what he

00:10:14.279 --> 00:10:15.880
is planning to do next.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:22.220
After his capture, he says that he will make
the world see that Pirates are the true rulers

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:27.970
of the sea and the last panel of chapter 0
has him straight out saying that he has a

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:28.970
20 year plan in the making.

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:34.940
And Oda has made it a point to show us how
much plotting and manipulating is going on

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:37.370
in the one piece world on multiple levels.

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:42.740
For example, Ceasar controlling Punk Hazard,
Doflamingo controlling Ceasar, Kaido controlling

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:47.250
Doflamingo, so could there be another link
in this chain?

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:51.940
We do know that Shiki has had connections
to all the big players in the world, the Roger

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:56.899
pirates, including Shanks and Buggy, the other
3 original Yonko and through Rocks, and God

00:10:56.899 --> 00:11:04.940
Valley he must have known some of the biggest
secrets of this world, like the existence

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.010
of Imu.

00:11:06.010 --> 00:11:09.500
Subscribe if you think Shiki would be a better
final villain than Imu.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:13.630
If Shiki is not only an active part of the
current one piece plot, but also has been

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:19.020
cooking up a major plot to take over the world,
what exactly is that plan?

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:23.110
For that, we need to start connecting all
the dots, we have put on the board so far.

00:11:23.110 --> 00:11:26.470
And the picture they paint is truly shocking.

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:27.550
Let’s start in Wano.

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:32.950
We have 3 things connecting him to the country:
Shiki’s Japanese Design, the floating temple

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:36.330
and his face used by Kurozumi Higurashi.

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:42.829
The last one tells us one thing, Higurashi
met and touched Shiki at least once.

00:11:42.829 --> 00:11:49.529
But why should Oda throw him in as a random
face, if it didn’t mean anything.

00:11:49.529 --> 00:11:52.070
Anything he does always means something.

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:57.519
One Option, is that Higurashi used to be part
of the Rocks pirates, which is a real possibility.

00:11:57.519 --> 00:12:01.350
But another one, is that she was in cahoots
with Shiki.

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:03.470
And this is where it gets interesting.

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:09.380
As you will recall, it was Kurozumi Higurashi
and her partner, who pushed Orochi into claiming

00:12:09.380 --> 00:12:14.500
the throne and who invited Kaido to take over
the country.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:19.600
They are the only source we have for the Kurozumi
hunt that happened after Orochi’s ancestor

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.440
killed the other daimyos.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.550
Only is that actually true?

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:28.680
Take Kanjuro’s parents for instance, they
were actors that were killed on stage after

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.410
being recognized by the audience.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:36.709
But let me ask you, would YOU become an actor
and play in front of the entire country if

00:12:36.709 --> 00:12:38.810
you were being hunted by everyone?

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:43.089
Wouldn’t you try to stay under the radar
or even leave the country, as some people

00:12:43.089 --> 00:12:46.630
from wano did, when they founded Shimotsuki
Village in the east blue.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:52.560
Could it not be, that it was this group of
people loyal to Rocks or Shiki who killed

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:58.640
Orochi’s and Kanuuro’s parents to create
an easy to control puppet that could take

00:12:58.640 --> 00:12:59.670
over Wano?

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:05.710
But what would Shiki get if he installed Kaido
and an easy to control puppet ruler in Wano?

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:11.029
Well, the one thing he wanted right from the
start, which started the Battle of Edd War

00:13:11.029 --> 00:13:12.190
with Roger.

00:13:12.190 --> 00:13:17.750
Shiki wanted an ancient weapon, and as we
now know there has been one sitting and waiting

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.560
right here in Wano.

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:23.980
Taking out Kaido, getting his Poneglyph PLUS
the ancient weapon Pluton.

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:28.760
You probably already know that the two people
who claim to be Kurozumis possessed two devil

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:31.480
fruits we already knew.

00:13:31.480 --> 00:13:34.620
Bartolomeos Barrier fruit and Bon Clay’s
mirror fruit.

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:38.329
But what if these two characters never actually
died.

00:13:38.329 --> 00:13:41.850
What if that pair IS Barolomeo and Bon Clay.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:46.590
i know that sounds stupid, because they are
two characters that have been 2 of Luffy’s

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:50.410
biggest allies, but have you ever wondered
why Bon Kurei joined Crocodile?

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:53.300
He doesn’t seem like the cold blooded type,
at least when he’s around Luffy.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:14:00.160
But Crocodile was also looking for an ancient
weapon in Alabasta, that was his whole mission

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.160
there.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:03.320
And Bon kurei has been associated with Impel
Down as well.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:07.660
Now you might already hate me for defiling
Bon Kurei’s memory, but surely there is

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:10.170
nothing shady going on with Bartolomeo.

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:15.180
Well, remember, that Bartolomeo burned one
of Shanks’ flags and claimed his island

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.180
for Luffy.

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:23.310
An action that’s basically means Luffy declaring
war on Shanks, something the Yonko has very

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:26.410
much noticed.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.810
A very strange thing for Barto to do.

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:31.440
And remember Apoo and his men running into
the sky?

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:38.000
Well the only other ability that could explain
that except Shiki himself, would be Bartolomeo’s

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:43.060
slash the old Kurozumi dude’s barrier power,
as we have seen it used on Dressrosa.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:46.399
Apoo became part of Kaido’s crew after this
strange event happened.

00:14:46.399 --> 00:14:49.779
So could Shiki have recruited him as an inside
man?

00:14:49.779 --> 00:14:51.610
Plan to take out Kaido.

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:53.240
Plan to take out Shanks.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:57.519
Using Luffy’s powers and role as Joy Boy
for himself.

00:14:57.519 --> 00:14:58.519
What about big mom?

00:14:58.519 --> 00:15:01.300
Well remember Bege and his levitating adventure?

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:07.680
Next time we see Bege, he has married into
Big Mom’s family to the sister of Lola,

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.690
who was supposed to marry Loki, the Prince
of the Giants.

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:17.040
And since big Mom and the giants aren’t
on speaking terms, because of a certain incident,

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:20.800
how did Loki get the opportunity to fall in
love with Lola?

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:29.459
Again we have a rival, Big Mom, a road poneglyph
and Elbaf, an island heavily associated with

00:15:29.459 --> 00:15:31.510
the missing ancient weapon uranus.

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:34.230
i made a whole video on that in case you’re
interested.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:37.800
And now, Big mom has also disappeared from
the playing field.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:39.170
What about Whitebeard?

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:42.500
He got infiltrated and manipulated by Blackbeard.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:47.360
And while there isn’t anything that proves
Shiki’s involvement here, both of them are

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:53.190
connected through Rocks, with Shiki being
the only one who shared his captains dream

00:15:53.190 --> 00:15:54.889
of world domination.

00:15:54.889 --> 00:15:59.510
And we have of course Caribou, a character,
who is with the straw hats right now, who

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:05.730
knows the location of not one but 2 ancient
weapons and who wants to report his findings

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.810
to a mysterious person as soon as possible.

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:13.889
Admittedly, the fact that Shiki has already
been revealed as the major villain of a non-canon

00:16:13.889 --> 00:16:19.319
film makes his reappearance more unlikely
than if he had just been name-dropped.

00:16:19.319 --> 00:16:25.360
However it also gave Oda the chance to implement
and introduce him as a character without messing

00:16:25.360 --> 00:16:26.700
up his storyline.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:34.029
He actually came out and said that he wanted
to write Shiki into the story before the film,

00:16:34.029 --> 00:16:39.000
but felt that it would overwhelm the audience
during the Alabasta Saga, where concepts like

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:41.830
poneglyphs, were just being introduced.

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:47.060
I think there is a really good chance, that
oda wanted us to know who this lurking legend

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:51.870
is and what he’s capable of, so that his
reveal as the evil mastermind at the end of

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:58.470
the story hits us a lot more than if it were
a new character we have never seen before.

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:03.850
A character that might already have taken
out 3 of 4 original rivals for the one piece,

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:09.130
who works with one of the new yonko and is
trying to start a war between the other 2.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:14.250
All to finally fullfil his dream to become
the ruler of pirates, and thus in his own

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.579
words the ruler of the seas.

00:17:16.579 --> 00:17:21.650
A dream that his rival Roger managed to fulfill
before him.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:28.160
And I think that these two characters actually
used to be friends, something that Shiki hints

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:30.289
at in this panel here.

00:17:30.289 --> 00:17:35.920
Shiki wears japanese cloths, but wano isn’t
the only country in one piece that has a japanese

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:36.920
theme going on.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:41.250
In the east blue, that Shiki despises for
some reason, there is an island called the

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:45.370
Oykot kingdom, which is literally Tokyo spelled
backwards*.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.550
And guess what.

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:52.000
It’s where Belmere found Nami and Nojiko
after it was destroyed by pirates.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:58.350
Belmere, who we saw in chapter 0 saying that
she’d come for Shiki if he ever came to

00:17:58.350 --> 00:18:00.010
the east blue again.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:05.750
Maybe Shiki came for Nami’s hometown, for
his hometown, which Oda hinted at with Nami’s

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.950
and Shiki’s relationship in Strong World.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:14.330
And if Shiki is from the east blue, he would
have become friends with the group of upcoming

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:15.410
rookies there.

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.890
Garp, Roger and Rocks.

00:18:17.890 --> 00:18:22.440
But if you want to hear the full story for
that, you can click here to watch that video

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:23.009
next.

